<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Specialist Letter</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.6; padding: 40px 50px; background: white; color: #333; max-width: 210mm; margin: 0 auto; }
        .letterhead { text-align: center; border-bottom: 2px solid #5b21b6; padding-bottom: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
        .letterhead h1 { color: #5b21b6; font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .letterhead .subtitle { color: #4a5568; font-size: 11pt; }
        .letterhead .contact { font-size: 9pt; color: #718096; margin-top: 10px; }
        .letter-info { margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .recipient { margin-bottom: 25px; }
        .recipient p { margin-bottom: 2px; }
        .salutation { margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .patient-box { background: #f7fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
        .patient-box h3 { font-size: 11pt; color: #5b21b6; margin-bottom: 10px; text-transform: uppercase; }
        .patient-box table { width: 100%; font-size: 10pt; }
        .patient-box td { padding: 2px 10px 2px 0; }
        .patient-box td:first-child { font-weight: bold; width: 120px; }
        .content p { margin-bottom: 15px; text-align: justify; }
        .content h4 { color: #5b21b6; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 11pt; }
        .content ul { margin-left: 25px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
        .content li { margin-bottom: 5px; }
        .good-news { background: #dcfce7; border: 1px solid #16a34a; padding: 10px 15px; margin: 15px 0; color: #166534; }
        .signature { margin-top: 40px; }
        .signature .name { font-weight: bold; }
        .signature .credentials { font-size: 10pt; color: #4a5568; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="letterhead">
        <h1>RHEUMATOLOGY MELBOURNE</h1>
        <div class="subtitle">Autoimmune & Inflammatory Disease Specialists</div>
        <div class="contact">Suite 405, Specialist Centre | 321 St Kilda Road, Melbourne VIC 3004<br>Phone: (03) 9888 4567</div>
    </div>

    <div class="letter-info"><p class="date">7 January 2026</p></div>

    <div class="recipient">
        <p><strong>Dr Sarah Mitchell</strong></p>
        <p>Mitchell Family Practice</p>
        <p>45 Clinic Road, Suburb VIC 3000</p>
    </div>

    <div class="salutation"><p>Dear Dr Mitchell,</p></div>

    <div class="patient-box">
        <h3>Patient Information</h3>
        <table>
            <tr><td>Patient Name:</td><td>Roberto MARTINEZ</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Date of Birth:</td><td>30/04/1971 (54 years)</td></tr>
            <tr><td>UR Number:</td><td>MRN-2019384</td></tr>
            <tr><td>Date of Review:</td><td>7 January 2026</td></tr>
        </table>
    </div>

    <div class="content">
        <p>I reviewed Mr Martinez today for his annual rheumatoid arthritis assessment.</p>

        <div class="good-news">
            <strong>Disease Status: REMISSION</strong><br>
            DAS28 Score: 2.4 (remission < 2.6)
        </div>

        <h4>Clinical Assessment</h4>
        <p>Mr Martinez reports feeling well with no joint pain, swelling, or morning stiffness. He continues to work full-time without limitation. Examination reveals no active synovitis. Inflammatory markers remain suppressed with CRP 3 mg/L and ESR 12 mm/hr.</p>

        <h4>Current Medications</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Methotrexate 20mg weekly (subcutaneous) - CONTINUE</li>
            <li>Folic acid 5mg weekly (day after methotrexate) - CONTINUE</li>
            <li>Hydroxychloroquine 200mg daily - CONTINUE</li>
        </ul>

        <h4>Monitoring Bloods</h4>
        <p>Annual screening bloods are satisfactory with stable FBC, LFTs within normal limits, and eGFR preserved at 85 mL/min.</p>

        <h4>Recommendations</h4>
        <ul>
            <li>Continue current DMARD therapy - well tolerated and effective</li>
            <li>FBC, LFT, U&E monitoring every 3 months - please arrange</li>
            <li>Rheumatology review in 6 months</li>
            <li>Annual influenza and COVID vaccination recommended</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="signature">
        <p class="name">Dr Emma Thompson</p>
        <p class="credentials">MBBS, FRACP, PhD</p>
        <p class="credentials">Consultant Rheumatologist</p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
